// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
// SapphireKV — Storage Engine Unit Tests
// Fayl: tests/test_store.zf
// Muallif: Jasper
// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

import "../src/store.zf" as store_mod
import std.datetime
import std.fs

print("[TEST 1] Store initsializatsiyasi...")
let test_aof = "test_store.aof"
if fs.exists(test_aof) {
    fs.remove(test_aof)
}

let db = store_mod.Store(null, 0, 0, 0, "")
db.init(test_aof)

print("[TEST 2] SET va GET tekshiruvi...")
db.set("name", "Jasper", 0.0)
let val = db.get("name")
if val != "Jasper" {
    print("XATO: val kutilgan 'Jasper' emas, balki: " + String(val))
    1 / 0
}
print("  ✓ SET va GET muvaffaqiyatli: name == " + String(val))

print("[TEST 3] EXISTS va DEL tekshiruvi...")
if db.exists("name") != true {
    print("XATO: exists('name') true bo'lishi kerak!")
    1 / 0
}
let deleted = db.del("name")
if deleted != true {
    print("XATO: del('name') true bo'lishi kerak!")
    1 / 0
}
if db.get("name") != null {
    print("XATO: o'chirilgan kalit null bo'lishi kerak!")
    1 / 0
}
print("  ✓ EXISTS va DEL muvaffaqiyatli")

print("[TEST 4] TTL (Muddati o'tish) tekshiruvi...")
db.set("session", "xyz123", 0.2) // 200 ms
if db.get("session") != "xyz123" {
    print("XATO: session dastlab mavjud bo'lishi kerak!")
    1 / 0
}
datetime.sleep_ms(300)
if db.get("session") != null {
    print("XATO: 300ms dan keyin session muddati o'tib null bo'lishi kerak edi!")
    1 / 0
}
print("  ✓ TTL lazy expiration muvaffaqiyatli")

print("[TEST 5] AOF Qayta Tiklash (Persistence) tekshiruvi...")
db.set("p_key", "mustahkam_qiymat", 0.0)
db.persist()

let db2 = store_mod.Store(null, 0, 0, 0, "")
db2.init(test_aof)
let recovered = db2.get("p_key")
if recovered != "mustahkam_qiymat" {
    print("XATO: AOF dan tiklangan qiymat mos kelmadi!")
    1 / 0
}
print("  ✓ AOF tiklash muvaffaqiyatli: " + String(recovered))

// Test AOF faylini tozalaymiz
if fs.exists(test_aof) {
    fs.remove(test_aof)
}

print("🎉 Barcha Store unit testlari 100% Yashil o'tdi!")
